[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot 396 - Encode before combat
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Hard
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Grizzly Bears and five untapped Swamps, and have Shadow Slice (target opponent loses 3 life; cipher) in hand. The opponent is at 8 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-cipher-precombat | Cipher exiles the spell encoded on a creature you control, and whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player you may cast a copy (CR 702.99a): cast Shadow Slice before combat and encode it on the Bears for 3+2+3=8; cast after combat it deals only 3+2
